{
    "title": "KOA | RV, Cabin & Tent Camping",
    "description": "Looking for the perfect camping adventure? Look no further than KOA campgrounds, where you'll find a range of camping options, from RV and tent camping to cozy cabins and luxurious glamping tents. With over 500 locations across the United States and Canada, KOA campgrounds offer the consistency in service, amenities, comfort, and technology that you need for a perfect camping experience.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a seasoned camper or just starting out, our KOA camping app makes it easy to find and book your next trip. With a KOA account, you can manage your camping preferences, save your favorite campgrounds, and see your upcoming and past reservation history all in one place. And if you're a KOA Rewards camper, you can also track your points, rewards, and more.\r\n\r\nHere are just some of the features you'll love about our app:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Find KOA campgrounds: With our easy-to-use search function and filtering capabilities, you can find the perfect KOA campground for your next outdoor experience, whether you're looking for RV parks, tent camping, cabin camping, or glamping. You can search by city, state, campground name, or even nearby attractions.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Interactive Map: Use our interactive map feature to see your location and nearby KOA campgrounds. Once you\u2019ve found your campground, use our integrated mapping services for hassle-free directions.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Book your stay: Once you've found the perfect campground, you can book your stay directly from the app. It's quick, easy, and secure.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Manage your account: With a KOA account, you can manage your camping preferences, save your favorite campgrounds, and see your upcoming and past reservation history all in one place.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Earn rewards: If you're a KOA Rewards camper, you can track your points, rewards, and more in the app.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Plan your trip: Get insider tips and recommendations for your next camping location, including local attractions, things to do, and more.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Push Notifications: opt-in to receive notifications from your favorite campgrounds for things like events, hot deals, and discounts.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Offline use: Campground information, search tools and driving directions all work offline, making the KOA app perfect for on-the-go campers.\r\n\r\nAt KOA, we believe camping is more than just pitching a tent or parking your RV. It's about creating memories, exploring new places, and experiencing the great outdoors with the people you love. With our app, we make it easy to find the perfect campground for your next trip, and to manage your reservations and rewards all in one place.\r\n\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Download the KOA app today and start planning your next camping adventure!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for the perfect camping adventure? Look no further than KOA campgrounds, where you&#39;ll find a range of camping options, from RV and tent camping to cozy cabins and luxurious glamping tents. With over 500 locations across the United States and Canada, KOA campgrounds offer the consistency in service, amenities, comfort, and technology that you need for a perfect camping experience.<br><br>Whether you&#39;re a seasoned camper or just starting out, our KOA camping app makes it easy to find and book your next trip. With a KOA account, you can manage your camping preferences, save your favorite campgrounds, and see your upcoming and past reservation history all in one place. And if you&#39;re a KOA Rewards camper, you can also track your points, rewards, and more.<br><br>Here are just some of the features you&#39;ll love about our app:<br><br>\u2022 Find KOA campgrounds: With our easy-to-use search function and filtering capabilities, you can find the perfect KOA campground for your next outdoor experience, whether you&#39;re looking for RV parks, tent camping, cabin camping, or glamping. You can search by city, state, campground name, or even nearby attractions.<br><br>\u2022 Interactive Map: Use our interactive map feature to see your location and nearby KOA campgrounds. Once you\u2019ve found your campground, use our integrated mapping services for hassle-free directions.<br><br>\u2022 Book your stay: Once you&#39;ve found the perfect campground, you can book your stay directly from the app. It&#39;s quick, easy, and secure.<br><br>\u2022 Manage your account: With a KOA account, you can manage your camping preferences, save your favorite campgrounds, and see your upcoming and past reservation history all in one place.<br><br>\u2022 Earn rewards: If you&#39;re a KOA Rewards camper, you can track your points, rewards, and more in the app.<br><br>\u2022 Plan your trip: Get insider tips and recommendations for your next camping location, including local attractions, things to do, and more.<br><br>\u2022 Push Notifications: opt-in to receive notifications from your favorite campgrounds for things like events, hot deals, and discounts.<br><br>\u2022 Offline use: Campground information, search tools and driving directions all work offline, making the KOA app perfect for on-the-go campers.<br><br>At KOA, we believe camping is more than just pitching a tent or parking your RV. It&#39;s about creating memories, exploring new places, and experiencing the great outdoors with the people you love. With our app, we make it easy to find the perfect campground for your next trip, and to manage your reservations and rewards all in one place.<br><br>So what are you waiting for? Download the KOA app today and start planning your next camping adventure!",
